nd proximity to renowned schools, colleges, hospitals, and public transport, Raghav Utopia stands out as an ideal choice for modern families seeking convenience and refined living. [...] Aquinas International School: 3.6 km\n\nRishi Valmiki Eco School: 4 km\n\nVIBGYOR High School: 4.8 km\n\nVivek College Of Commerce: 4.5 km\n\nRavindra Bharati College: 4.8 km\n\nH K Institute Of Management Studies & Research: 4.9 km\n\nPrarthana Hospital and ICU: 3.1 km\n\nOscar Superspeciality Hospital: 3.5 km\n\nKapadia Multispecialty Hospital: 3.9 km\n\nInfiniti Mall: 900 m\n\nMalad West Metro Station: 600 m\n\nMalad Railway Station: 2.4 km\n\n## Construction & Delivery Timeline\n\nRaghav Utopia is under construction, with an expected possession date of December 2029.\n\n## Summary\n\nRaghav Utopia offers spacious, premium 2 and 3 BHK homes in an exclusive low-density community with modern amenities and excellent connectivity.\n\n### Pros","score":0.9396537,"raw_content":null,"id":"1558eb-01"},{"url":"https://divyahousingagency.com/project/raghav-utopia","title":"RAGHAV UTOPIA in Goregaon West | Price & RERA","content":"Divya Housing Agency — Property Consultants Malad West Mumbai \n\nWhatsApp   9892340129\n\nDivya Housing Agency\n\nUnder Construction\n\n# RAGHAV UTOPIA\n\nby Raghav Group\n\nShastri Nagar · Goregaon West · Road No. 1, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n₹2.20 Cr – ₹2.75 Cr++\n\nCall   WhatsApp\n\nConfig 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nTotal Floors G + 4 Level Podium Carpark + 17 Habitable Floors\n\nPossession Dec 2029\n\nRAGHAV UTOPIA — Photo 1 1 / 10\n\nRAGHAV UTOPIA — Master Plan\n\nOutright Options\n\n## For Sale / Resale Options at RAGHAV UTOPIA\n\nFor Sale · Apartment Available\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n732 SqFtCarpet Area ₹2.20 CrIndicative Price\n\nEnquire for Option View Unit Details\n\nFor Sale · Apartment Available\n\n### 3 BHK\n\n908 SqFtCarpet Area ₹2.75 CrIndicative Price\n\nEnquire for Option View Unit Details\n\nOverview [...] ## Amenities & Features\n\nCar Parking\n\nCCTV Security\n\nElEVators\n\nGym\n\nKids' Play Area\n\nSenior Citizen's Corner\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nVastu Compliant\n\nGetting Here\n\n## Location & Connectivity\n\nNearest Metro\n\nBangur Nagar Metro Station\n\nNearest Railway\n\nGoregaon Railway Station\n\nRoad Connectivity\n\nLink Road — 2 min · SV Road — 5 min · Western Express Highway — 10 min\n\nNearest Landmark\n\nVibgyor High School / City Centre / Infinity Mall\n\nTravel times are indicative and may vary by route and traffic conditions.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions — RAGHAV UTOPIA\n\n  What is the current price range at RAGHAV UTOPIA? + \n\nThe current listed price range is ₹2.20 Cr – ₹2.75 Cr++. Prices are indicative and exclude stamp duty, registration and other applicable charges. [...] Raghav Utopia is a premium residential tower developed by Raghav Group, strategically situated at Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai. The project presents an exclusive collection of well-ventilated 2 BHK and 3 BHK balcony homes designed to maximize usable carpet space and urban comfort.\n\nFeaturing a modern structure with G+4 podium parking levels and 17 habitable residential floors, Raghav Utopia combines sophisticated design with daily convenience. Residents benefit from rapid connectivity to SV Road, Link Road, Western Express Highway, and Goregaon Railway Station, along with quick access to top schools like Vibgyor High, healthcare centers, and shopping destinations like Inorbit Mall and Infinity Mall.","score":0.93206495,"raw_content":null,"id":"f04a17-02"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_raghav-utopia-goregaon-west_8086.html","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","content":"2 BHK Flats\n\nCarpet Area : 732 Sq.ft.\n\n3 BHK Flats\n\nCarpet Area : 884 Sq.ft, 908 Sq.ft.\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\nBalcony Homes\n\nPodium Carpark\n\nSwimming Pool + Gym\n\nNo Possession Charges\n\nRental Scheme Benefits\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK Floor Plan\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\nRERA No: PR1180002501406\n\nDeveloper: Raghav Raj Builders\n\nProject: Raghav Utopia\n\nVerify on MahaRERA Website →\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Mitha Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\nAddress: Mitha Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\nClose To: SV Road, Link Road, Mitha Nagar Road, Goregaon Railway Station Road, Bangur Nagar\n\n#### Schools\n\nVIBGYOR High Goregaon, St. John€™s Universal School, Oberoi International School\n\n#### Hospitals [...] Raghav Raj Builders' unwavering commitment to excellence shines through this RERA-registered project—PR1180002501406—ensuring transparency and timely delivery. Mitha Nagar's prime locale near Oberoi Mall, Mindspace IT Park, and Film City expansions positions Raghav Utopia as Mumbai's foremost address for appreciation and aspiration. Goregaon West's infrastructure renaissance amplifies its allure, blending suburban tranquility with metropolitan momentum.\n\nSeize your legacy at Raghav Utopia, where Mumbai's dreams converge in Goregaon West's golden embrace. Let Raghav Raj Builders redefine your horizon with balcony bliss, podium perfection, and boundless potential. Your utopia awaits—claim it today.  \n  \n\n2 BHK Flats\n\nCarpet Area : 732 Sq.ft.\n\n3 BHK Flats [...] by Kolte Patil Developers Ltd.\n\n### Kolte Patil Vivere\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK & 3 BHK Flats\n\nArea Carpet Area: 725 Sq.ft - 1106 Sq.ft\n\nPrice 2.61 Cr Onwards\n\nView More\n\n## Property Deals\n\nExplore every segment - from luxury homes to distress deals, we have it all.\n\n🏰\n\n### Luxury Homes\n\nSea-facing apartments, penthouses & bungalows\n\n→ 🏢\n\n### Corporate Leasing\n\nPremium office spaces & corporate accommodations\n\n→ 📑\n\n### Preleased Properties\n\nEarn rental income from day one of purchase\n\n→ 🏨\n\n### Hotels & Resorts\n\nHospitality assets & resort investme