, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across 0.19 acres with 1 towers with G+4P+17 floors. Each floor has 5 flats per floor, 3 lifts, 1 staircases. It is available in 2BHK/3BHK configurations with carpet areas ranging from 721 to 908 sq. ft.","score":0.90810597,"raw_content":null,"id":"4a5c96-04"},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/property/raghav-utopia-PB17797795061150","title":"2 BHK in Raghav Utopia, Goregaon West — 2.15 Cr (₹29,372/sqft) | Property Butler","content":"• RERA: PR1180002501406 • Developer: Raghav Raj Builders (Raghav Group) — Mumbai-based developer since 2014, projects in Kurla, Borivali, Chembur, Goregaon & Pune • Location: Goregaon West — Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, near Bangur Nagar Metro Station • Connectivity: Bangur Nagar Metro Station ~550m, SV Road ~900m, Western Express Highway ~5 min, International Airport ~20 min • Amenities: Swimming pool, gymnasium, multipurpose sports court, kids play area, landscaped garden, grand lobby, CCTV, 24x7 security, podium carpark, rainwater harvesting, STP • Highlights: G+4 Level Podium Carpark + 17 habitable floors; all-inclusive pricing with no floor rise; no possession charges; rental scheme benefits available; balcony homes; builder target possession Dec 2028 / RERA possession Dec 2029\n\nPS [...] Skip to content\n\nProperty Butler\n\nPROPERTYBUTLER\n\nWhatsApp Advisor\n\n# 2 BHK Residentialin Raghav Utopia\n\nGoregaon West\n\n2.15 Cr\n\nFor SaleBuilder finish\n\n## Property Details\n\nType\n\nResidential\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n732 sq.ft\n\nTransaction\n\nSale\n\nFurnishing\n\nBuilder finish\n\nPossession\n\nDec 2028\n\nFloor\n\nLow Floor (1-7)\n\nView\n\nOpen View\n\nDeveloper\n\nRaghav Raj Builders (Raghav Group)\n\nWing / Unit\n\nA, 01\n\n## About This Property\n\n### Project Details [...] 1.6cr₹23,460/sqft\n\nArea682 sqft\n\nFloorMid Floor (8-15)\n\nPossessionAug 20